OL,3,AHome secretary scraps plan for migrant
OL,4,Acare workers already in UK to wait 15
OL,5,Ayears for settlement
OL,6,
OL,7,FShabana Mahmood scraps plans for
OL,8,Fmigrant care workers already in the UK
OL,9,Fto wait 15 years for permanent
OL,10,Fsettlement - watch her speaking in the
OL,11,FCommons live above
OL,13,FAs long as they earn at least #25,000
OL,14,Fand arrived in the UK before May 2025,
OL,15,Fthese workers will be eligible for
OL,16,Findefinite leave to remain (ILR) after
OL,17,Ffive years
OL,19,FMahmood also drops the requirement for
OL,20,Fany low income workers to wait for 15
OL,21,Fyears before getting ILR, reducing it
OL,22,Fto 10
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/42
