OL,3,AHunt for attackers after Halloween
OL,4,Aparty stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are hunting for attackers who
OL,7,Fstabbed five teenage boys at a
OL,8,FHalloween party in Hampshire.
OL,10,FOfficers said an "unknown group" had
OL,11,Fgained entry to the party at a house in
OL,12,FPark Road, Chandler's Ford, and the
OL,13,Fstabbings happened shortly after 22:30
OL,14,FGMT on Saturday. Three boys aged 16 and
OL,15,Ftwo aged 17 were all taken to hospital
OL,16,Fwith serious injuries.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/42
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
