OL,3,AHunt for attackers after Halloween
OL,4,Aparty stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarton Peveril said it believes two of
OL,7,Fthose attacked are students at the
OL,8,Fsixth form college. In a statement, it
OL,9,Fsaid support was being offered and "our
OL,10,Fthoughts are with the victims and their
OL,11,Ffamilies".
OL,13,FHampshire Police wants to speak to
OL,14,Fanyone who was there or has footage,
OL,15,Fincluding doorbell camera footage,
OL,16,Fcovering Park Road and the nearby area.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/42
