OL,3,AMillions vote early in US midterms as
OL,4,ADemocrat's shock Republican endorsement
OL,5,Arocks Michigan race
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's the final day of campaigning in
OL,8,Fthe US midterms, where voters will
OL,9,Fdecide which party controls Congress
OL,10,Ffor the rest of Donald Trump's
OL,11,Fpresidency - see how these elections
OL,12,Fcould reshape US politics
OL,14,FA row has erupted in the Democratic
OL,15,FParty after Michigan congresswoman
OL,16,FHaley Stevens, who missed out on the
OL,17,Fparty's Senate nomination in the state
OL,18,Fto Abdul El-Sayed, endorsed Republican
OL,19,Frival Mike Rogers
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/42
