OL,3,AMillions vote early in US midterms as
OL,4,ADemocrat's shock Republican endorsement
OL,5,Arocks Michigan race
OL,6,
OL,7,FMillions of Americans have already
OL,8,Fvoted, with a new midterm record set in
OL,9,FGeorgia, where a third of all
OL,10,Fregistered voters state-wide have cast
OL,11,Ftheir ballots already
OL,13,FTrump's Republican party currently
OL,14,Fcontrols both chambers of Congress -
OL,15,Fthe Senate and the House of
OL,16,FRepresentatives. Democrats are hoping
OL,17,Fto flip enough seats to win a majority
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/42
